Add ISO C11 threads, <threads.h>, over POSIX threads.

uClibc-ng had no C11 threads, which foot and fcft (and other current
programs) use.  thrd_*, mtx_*, cnd_*, tss_* and call_once are thin
wrappers in libpthread, as glibc's were before 2.34; thrd_create passes
the int-returning start function through a trampoline.

